        "content": "## Finance Q&A agent\nRuns fully local: **qwen3 4B** and **nomic-embed-text** on Ollama. Answers cite invoice numbers.\nLLM-written SQL goes through **4a safe_sql** as the read-only `finance_agent` role. Semantic search and chat memory use fixed node queries.",
